  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'KEEP YOUR HEADLIGHTS ON. TRUST YOUR EYES, NOT EVERY SIGN.


    Find the
    ritual objects in the maze, restore the four wards and escape through the farm
    gate. Corn passages change only while clear of vehicles. The scarecrow moves
    faster when nobody watches and hears engines. Face it with headlights to slow
    its approach; use alternate passages to escape. HOLD ACTION beside a ward to
    activate it.


    Movement uses your assigned driving controls. ACTION away
    from a station toggles headlights. Each human keeps an independent truck and
    camera. Cooperative variants share objectives and never award individual winner
    points. Eliminated participants spectate surviving trucks. Rematch restores the
    whole venue, cargo and encounters. Default match: four minutes.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
